expanse, interspersed with oversized organic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:34.400 --> 00:22:40.480
structures suspended within it. Sticking with&nbsp;
Yorozu’s bug theme, these structures bear a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:45.880
resemblance to the detached brains and spinal&nbsp;
nerve cords of insects. As I mentioned above,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:52.640
the main feature of Threefold affliction is&nbsp;
bringing a construction into the domain, mainly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:52.640 --> 00:22:57.520
her perfect sphere creation. If this ability&nbsp;
enters the domain, it will result in her win.

